## Notes for AI Agents
- Always create a branch before making changes
- Never bypass the PR requirement by pushing to main
- Include clear commit messages that explain the "why" not just the "what"
- Test changes locally when possible before pushing
- Review the diff before committing
- When creating PRs, analyze ALL commits that will be included (not just the latest)
